        },
        "quote": "(1) The removal, increase or stockpiling of any earthwork exceeds one foot in height and the amount of materials to be removed, increased or stockpiled exceeds 100 cubic yards.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:17.05.060:block:1#text",
